          BOX("rule", "The pronouns change too", t="The indirect object **sa ákin** in the mag- sentence becomes the subject **ako** in the -an sentence, and the doer **ka** becomes **mo** (see Lesson 6 on personal and demonstrative pronouns)."),
          H("II. With a direct object"),
          P("If the -um- or mag- sentence **has a direct object** (the noun or pronoun that receives the action), that object is preceded by the possessive article **ng** in the -an sentence. The indirect object and the doer follow rule I."),
